					{
						"name": "PID;Lot Frontage;Lot Area;Street;Alley;Lot Shape;Land Contour;Utilities;Lot Config;Land Slope;Neighborhood;Condition 1;Condition 2;Bldg Type;House Style;Overall Qual;Overall Cond;Year Built;Year Remod/Add",
